{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-backend","type":"group","x":-770,"y":-1000,"width":1250,"height":2040,"color":"5","label":"Backend Services"},
		{"id":"g-engines","type":"group","x":-1760,"y":-1000,"width":840,"height":2029,"color":"2","label":"Inference Engines"},
		{"id":"g-infra","type":"group","x":-1340,"y":1240,"width":1750,"height":440,"color":"4","label":"Infrastructure"},
		{"id":"g-frontend","type":"group","x":600,"y":-880,"width":400,"height":1192,"color":"6","label":"Frontend / Desktop"},
		{"id":"n-fullram","type":"text","text":"## FullRAM Engine\n\nLoads entire model into\nVRAM or RAM at once\n\nMaximum throughput\nCompute-bound (GPU TFLOPS)\n\nRequires 16GB+ RAM\nor 8GB+ VRAM\n\nStandard Hugging Face\ntransformers pipeline\n\nBest for speed priority\non memory-rich systems","x":-1620,"y":-960,"width":220,"height":428,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-ls-sched","type":"text","text":"Layer Scheduler\n\nPrefetch next layer\nduring current compute\n\nLRU eviction policy\nfor layer replacement\n\nWeightSplitter pre-processes\nGGUF into .safetensors chunks","x":-1230,"y":73,"width":220,"height":308,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-fullram-exec","type":"text","text":"FullRAM Executor\n\nWraps model.generate()\nin asyncio.to_thread()\n\nTextIteratorStreamer\nfor real-time tokens\n\nFP16 on CUDA,\nFP32 on CPU\n\nExplicit del + empty_cache()\nfor memory cleanup","x":-1620,"y":-461,"width":220,"height":374,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-shared","type":"text","text":"## Shared / TurboQuant\n\nQJL, PolarQuant\nquantization schemes\n\nshared/inference.py\nshared/tokenizer.py\n\nUsed by both engines\nfor weight handling","x":-1510,"y":-3,"width":220,"height":307,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-manualstream","type":"text","text":"## ManualStream\n\nFallback engine\nwhen LayerStream unavailable\n\nSimple sequential\nlayer execution\n\nMinimal memory\noverhead","x":-1680,"y":441,"width":220,"height":281,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-ls-bench","type":"text","text":"LayerStream Benchmark\n\nQuantization configs\n(Q4_0, Q5_K_M, Q8_0)\n\nThroughput measurement\ntokens/sec profiling","x":-1570,"y":764,"width":220,"height":219,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-layerstream","type":"text","text":"## LayerStream Engine\n\nStreams one layer at\na time from disk to RAM\n\nEnables 70B+ models\non just 8GB RAM\n\nI/O-bound (SSD bandwidth)\n~1.14 tokens/sec on PCIe Gen3\n\nVRAM: single layer only\n(~1-2% of model size)\n\nCustom two-phase pipeline:\nprefill + autoregressive decode","x":-1250,"y":-938,"width":240,"height":516,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-ls-kvcache","type":"text","text":"KV Cache Manager\n\nStored in system RAM\n(not VRAM)\n\nGrows linearly with\ncontext length\n\nContext sliding: pins\nsystem prompt, prunes oldest\ntokens when limit hit","x":-1230,"y":466,"width":220,"height":292,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-nextjs","type":"text","text":"### React Frontend\n\nNext.js 16 + React 19\nTypeScript\n\nReal-time token streaming\nvia WebSocket\n\nZustand state management\n(~1KB, zero boilerplate)\n\nTailwind CSS v4\nshadcn/ui component library\nVite bundler","x":650,"y":-860,"width":260,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-electron","type":"text","text":"### Electron Desktop\n\nNative OS shell\nSystem tray support\nNative menu bars\n\nSpawns FastAPI backend\nas child process\n\nGraceful shutdown:\nSIGTERM halts inference,\nunmaps GGUF, closes SQLite","x":650,"y":-447,"width":260,"height":307,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-db","type":"text","text":"### SQLite Database\n\nServerless, zero-config\nSingle .db file\nACID compliant, crash recovery\n\nStores: chat history,\nmodel registry, plugin states,\nhardware profiles, settings\n\nPeriodic VACUUM compaction\nMinimal ~250KB footprint","x":-470,"y":-570,"width":240,"height":376,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-providers","type":"text","text":"### Model Providers\n\nlocal.py: local filesystem\nhuggingface.py: HF Hub\ngenterprise_repo.py: enterprise\nusb_bundle.py: USB drives\nregistry.py: provider registry\n\nMultiple sources\nfor model retrieval","x":-740,"y":-584,"width":240,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-api","type":"text","text":"### API Routes\n\n/v1/chat/completions\n/v1/models/load/pull/list\n/v1/system/status/hardware\n/metrics (WebSocket)\n\nREST + WebSocket gateway\nAll inference, management, streaming","x":-270,"y":-960,"width":220,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# SovereignAI Edge\n\nPortable offline AI platform\nZero-internet operation\n100% local inference\n\nDual-engine architecture:\nFullRAM (high-memory)\nLayerStream (low-memory)\n\nGGUF model support\nAutomatic hardware detection\n\nPrivacy-first: no telemetry\nAir-gapped environments","x":-730,"y":-1600,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-core","type":"text","text":"### Hardware Profiler\n\nDetects RAM, VRAM, CPU features\nRoutes to FullRAM, LayerStream, or GPU\n\nAuto-selects best engine\nbased on available memory","x":-720,"y":-960,"width":240,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-cli-ui","type":"text","text":"CLI UI Panels\n\npanels.py: layout\nprogress.py: progress bars\ntables.py: data display\ntheme.py: consistent styling\n\nRich terminal output\nfor all CLI commands","x":690,"y":720,"width":260,"height":252,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-cli","type":"text","text":"### Sovereign CLI\n\nTyper + Rich\nsovereign run <model>\nsovereign serve\nsovereign list\n\nsovereign pull <model>\nsovereign remove <model>\nsovereign benchmark\n\nPower user scripting\nOffline model management","x":690,"y":344,"width":260,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-electron-build","type":"text","text":"### Electron Build\n\nelectron-builder packaging\nWindows, macOS, Linux\n\nPortable distribution\n(no registry, no install)\n\nUSB/SSD executable\nready-to-run","x":650,"y":-60,"width":260,"height":282,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n-vectorstore","type":"text","text":"### Vector Store (RAG)\n\nFAISS index for\nsemantic search\n\nchunker.py: splits docs\nembedding_pipeline.py: vectorize\nretriever.py: similarity search\n\nLocal document Q&A\nwithout internet","x":-690,"y":612,"width":220,"height":384,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-settings","type":"text","text":"### Settings\n\ndefaults.py: app defaults\ndatabase.py: DB config\nservice.py: service config\nrouter.py: route config\n\nStartup validation\nof all configurations","x":220,"y":-45,"width":200,"height":357,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-security","type":"text","text":"### Security\n\naudit.py: compliance checks\nencryption.py: data at rest\nlicense.py: licensing enforcement\n\nNo telemetry, no internet\nAir-gapped operation\nStrict no-data-leave policy","x":220,"y":-680,"width":220,"height":378,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n-schemas","type":"text","text":"### Schemas (Pydantic)\n\nStrict type validation\nat API boundaries\n\nEnforces: temperature\n(0.0-2.0), top-p, max_tokens\n\nEnsures consistent JSON\nacross all endpoints\n\nPlugin hook parameter\nvalidation","x":-50,"y":-532,"width":220,"height":392,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-ls-exec","type":"text","text":"LayerStream Executor\n\ninit_empty_weights()\nscaffold (no allocation)\n\nExecute_forward() loop:\nload layer, compute,\nflush, repeat\n\nNo Hugging Face generate()\nCustom Sampler class","x":-1200,"y":-306,"width":220,"height":303,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n-plugins","type":"text","text":"### Plugin System\n\nPython scripts in ./plugins/\n@hook('pre_prompt')\n@hook('post_generation')\n\nHot-reload without restart\nSandboxed via importlib\n\nUse cases: RAG injection,\ncustom formatting, safety filters\n\nBuilt-in: PDF ingestion,\ncode analysis","x":-710,"y":-155,"width":240,"height":375,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-tests","type":"text","text":"### Testing\n\npytest (backend)\npnpm test (frontend)\n\nAutomated test suite\nfor quality assurance","x":-1290,"y":1260,"width":240,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-docs","type":"text","text":"### Obsidian Wiki\n\nInfo_docs vault\nWiki synthesis from Docs/\nindex.md + log.md maintained\n\nImmutable source docs + LLM summaries","x":-960,"y":1260,"width":240,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-ci","type":"text","text":"### CI/CD Pipeline\n\nAutomated builds\nTesting & deployment\n\nContinuous integration\nfor all platforms","x":-670,"y":1260,"width":240,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-deploy","type":"text","text":"### Distribution\n\nnpm run build:win\nPortable offline\n\nCross-platform builds\nvia electron-builder","x":-360,"y":1260,"width":240,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n-websocket","type":"text","text":"### WebSocket Metrics\n\n/metrics endpoint\nReal-time token streaming\n\nStreams inference progress\nto frontend UI\n\nAsync-native, non-blocking\nduring generation","x":-740,"y":326,"width":240,"height":279,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-svc-quantizer","type":"text","text":"Model Quantizer\n\nApplies quantization:\nQ4_0, Q5_K_M, Q8_0\n\nTrade-off: size vs quality\nMemory/accuracy balance","x":-340,"y":-62,"width":180,"height":311,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-svc-modelmgr","type":"text","text":"Model Manager Service\n\nCoordinates model lifecycle:\nload, unload, monitor\n\nTracks model state\n(IDLE, LOADING, BUSY)\n\nModel metadata + path\nmanagement","x":-50,"y":-66,"width":210,"height":336,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-svc-downloader","type":"text","text":"Model Downloader\n\nFetches models from\nHuggingFace and providers\n\nResume interrupted\ndownloads\n\nProgress tracking\nvia CLI panels","x":-400,"y":367,"width":180,"height":355,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-model-manager","type":"text","text":"### Model Manager\n\nloader.py: loads models\ndownloader.py: fetches\ndetector.py: model detection\nregistry.py: metadata catalog\nrouter.py: model routing\n\nCoordinates entire\nmodel lifecycle","x":220,"y":466,"width":200,"height":417,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n-svc-vectorstore","type":"text","text":"Vector Store Service\n\nRAG storage service\nFAISS index management\n\nDocument chunking\nand embedding pipeline","x":20,"y":367,"width":180,"height":342,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n-svc-registry","type":"text","text":"Model Registry\n\nModel metadata catalog\nPaths and configurations\n\nRegistry persistence\nin SQLite","x":-250,"y":780,"width":220,"height":207,"color":"3"}
	],
